<title>POLAND: PEPEES MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>PEPEES MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.53 vs   1.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.64 vs   2.32</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.08 vs   2.52</p>
<p> Sales		   13.56 vs  13.83</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.83 vs   5.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.94 vs   7.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.23 vs   7.76</p>
<p> Sales		   49.88 vs  57.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food processing firm is</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Przemyslu Spozywczego PEPEES SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
